cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Guarded Swarms ROS 2"
abstract: >-
  A ROS 2 digital twin of the Guarded Swarms architecture for heterogeneous
  UAV/UGV swarms: sensing agents, a TB-CSPN coordination chain that releases
  missions only under a supervisor's authorisation, and a Safety Board on every
  vehicle that can veto its commands. Every vehicle runs PX4 SITL in Gazebo
  Harmonic.
